---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const title = 'Privacy Policy | dogbitesettlementcalc.com';
const description = 'Privacy policy for dogbitesettlementcalc.com — how we collect, use, and protect visitor data, including Google AdSense and Google Analytics.';
---
<BaseLayout title={title} description={description}>
  <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
  <p><strong>Effective date:</strong> January 1, 2026. Last reviewed: May 2026.</p>
  <p>dogbitesettlementcalc.com is committed to operating transparently with respect to data collection. This policy explains what information is collected when you use this site, how it is used, and what choices you have.</p>

  <h2>Who We Are</h2>
  <p>dogbitesettlementcalc.com is operated by The Click Lab (business email: <a href="mailto:hey@theclicklab.agency">hey@theclicklab.agency</a>). We operate a portfolio of free legal and financial reference websites monetized through Google AdSense display advertising.</p>

  <h2>Information We Collect</h2>
  <p>We do not collect personal information directly from visitors. We do not operate account registration, comment sections, email lists, or contact forms that capture personal data. Data collection occurs only through third-party services embedded in the site:</p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Google AdSense:</strong> Displays advertising. Google collects usage data, device information, and IP address to serve relevant ads. AdSense may use cookies and similar tracking technologies, governed by Google&rsquo;s Privacy Policy at <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">policies.google.com/privacy</a>.</li>
    <li><strong>Google Analytics:</strong> We use Google Analytics 4 to collect aggregate traffic data — page views, session duration, geographic region, and device type. Analytics cookies are used to distinguish sessions; no personally identifiable information is collected.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>Calculator inputs (medical costs, lost wages, severity, liability type, provocation) are processed entirely in your browser using JavaScript. No calculator inputs are transmitted to our servers or to any third party.</p>

  <h2>Cookies</h2>
  <p>We do not set first-party cookies. Google AdSense and Google Analytics set cookies on your device. Opt out of personalized advertising at <a href="https://adssettings.google.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">adssettings.google.com</a>. Opt out of Google Analytics at <a href="https://tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google&rsquo;s opt-out page</a>.</p>

  <h2>Data Sharing</h2>
  <p>We do not sell, rent, or share visitor data with third parties beyond Google as described above.</p>

  <h2>Children&rsquo;s Privacy</h2>
  <p>This site is not directed at children under 13. We do not knowingly collect data from children.</p>

  <h2>Changes to This Policy</h2>
  <p>We will update this policy when our data practices change. The effective date reflects the date of the most recent update.</p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>Questions? Email <a href="mailto:hey@theclicklab.agency">hey@theclicklab.agency</a>.</p>

  <p>Return to the <a href="/">calculator</a> or see the <a href="/terms/">terms of use</a>.</p>
</BaseLayout>
